{"body":[{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28140_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"p","x":"LAS VEGAS, USA (AVING Special Report on 'CES 2007') -- <Visual News> Now that one of the hottest issues of CES 2007 is certainly Full HD and Sony presented its press conference on the company’s Full HD products through Full HD broadcasting to press members during the time."},{"t":"p","x":"So, while several Sony officials delivered presentation on their products rotating around several stages that were divided in each theme, the reporters were able to grasp the gist of all the explanation sitting at a place through the broadcasting presented by the company."},{"t":"p","x":"Meanwhile Sony promised that it will bring more HD contents into Blu-Ray DVD format by partnering with more contents providers such as AOL and major Hollywood movie production companies."},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28141_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28142_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28143_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28144_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28145_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28146_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28147_4026.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28148_4027.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28149_4027.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28150_4027.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28151_4027.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200701/6598_28152_4027.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","s